node_modules
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/dist
# Excluded with the dist it describes, never without: an incremental build
# stamp that survives into the image tells tsc the output is current, and
# tsc emits nothing. The image builds green and the container then dies at
# startup on a module that was never written.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Every Next output directory, not only the default name. `**/.next` matches a
# segment spelled exactly that, so a custom `distDir` — `.next-dev` here, which
# the dev server needs because Next 16 ignores the argv form — was copied in and
# type-checked. Its generated route validator still named a page that had moved,
# so the image failed to build on a file no human wrote and none of the source
# referenced.
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
.claude
.cursor
docs
scripts/test-flows.sh
scripts/seed-flows.ts
scripts/export-operation-catalog.ts
